@@ -1,3 +1,54 @@
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local7) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Let images and videos grow to 85% of the monitor work area instead of
+    800x600; small images keep their native size, text and HTML keep 800x600.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:01:47 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local6) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Ignore the LibreOffice exit when the preview was closed during the
+    conversion, and keep the loader alive until the conversion exits.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:58:44 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local5) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Add an UpdateFile D-Bus method so an open preview follows the Nemo
+    selection, and stop taking the keyboard focus when a preview opens.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:49:36 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local4) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Stop the toolbar fade-out when the preview window closes, now that the
+    process outlives its windows.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:31:23 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local3) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Fix a double free of the converted PDF path when an office document
+    preview is closed and the loader is later disposed.
+  * Disconnect the video player signals when the video preview is closed.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:27:40 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local2) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Stay alive 10 minutes after the last preview closes, so the next
+    preview skips the process startup.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:23:39 +0100
+
+nemo-preview (6.4.0+local1) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * Open PDF and office documents in a plain GTK window: the Clutter-embedded
+    xreader view froze on scroll (linuxmint/nemo-extensions#593).
+  * Keep the preview window centered when it resizes to fit its content.
+
+ -- Local build <root@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:12:42 +0100
+
